# No `version` and `date-released`: there are no releases before the move
# of the repository to GA4GH (see "Releases" in `docs/development.md`); a
# release sets them, and a DOI follows with the first archived release
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or the profile, please cite it using the metadata
  from this file. Until there are releases, also give the commit that you
  used.
title: GA4GH IO Schema Profile
abstract: >-
  A proposed GA4GH JSON Schema profile, with a meta-schema and a Python
  package, for the inputs and outputs of workflows and workflow components:
  an engine-neutral contract above workflow languages (e.g., CWL, WDL,
  Nextflow, Snakemake) that lets WES clients render input forms, check input
  values before they submit a run, and normalise the outputs of runs.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Alexander
    family-names: Kanitz
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3468-0652"
    affiliation: >-
      Biozentrum, University of Basel, Basel, Switzerland; SIB Swiss Institute
      of Bioinformatics, Lausanne, Switzerland
repository-code: "https://github.com/elixir-cloud-aai/ga4gh-io-schema"
url: "https://ga4gh-io-schema.readthedocs.io/"
keywords:
  - GA4GH
  - JSON Schema
  - workflows
  - WES
  - TRS
  - CWL
  - WDL
  - Nextflow
  - Snakemake
license: Apache-2.0
